# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18366 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_505857f0:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I should hurry and get her going on her chores so I can make it to school today.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Dovrei sbrigarmi a farle fare le sue faccende così posso arrivare a scuola oggi.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18367 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_e21de33e_1:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}And is she really drinking this early in the morning?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}E lei sta davvero bevendo a quest'ora del mattino?{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18370 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_7e6fdb25_1:
msgid "[_R_] Hey Aunt Camille. How was your workout with Mom this morning?"
msgstr "[_R_] Ehi zia Camille. Come è stato il tuo allenamento con la mamma questa mattina?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18372 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_a0806b80_1:
msgid "[_C_] Oh, she called and said she wouldn't be able to workout this morning, she didn't really say why, just that she was going to be screwed if she didn't get some things done."
msgstr "[_C_] Oh, ha chiamato e ha detto che non sarebbe stata in grado di allenarsi questa mattina, non ha detto il perché, solo che sarebbe stata fregata se non avesse fatto alcune cose."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18373 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_e28c5967_1:
msgid "[_C_] I'm guessing something to do with her school."
msgstr "[_C_] Immagino che qualcosa abbia a che fare con la sua scuola."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18374 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_fc054ecf_1:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Haha.... she was just screwing herself.... {/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Haha.... stava solo fregando se stessa.... {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18376 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_6bea71fe_1:
msgid "[_C_] It was pretty tiring actually.... your mom is in pretty good shape.... she really wore me out."
msgstr "[_C_] E' stato piuttosto faticoso in effetti.... tua madre è in ottima forma.... mi ha davvero sfinito."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18377 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_0ccb4807_1:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I wish I'd spent the morning letting Mom wear me out.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Vorrei aver trascorso la mattina lasciando che la mamma mi indossa fuori.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18378 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_a2a4fcea:
msgid "[_C_] So, as you can see, I'm getting started with a few glasses of wine. You got a problem with that?"
msgstr "[_C_] Quindi, come puoi vedere, sto iniziando con qualche bicchiere di vino. Hai un problema con questo?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18381 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_609fe9c7:
msgid "[_R_] You keep drinking that stuff like it's water.... where do you keep finding it?.... I didn't even know we had that much in the house."
msgstr "[_R_] Continui a bere quella roba come se fosse acqua.... dove continui a trovarla?.... Non sapevo nemmeno che ne avessimo così tanto in casa."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18384 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_assign_chores_8fb3b094:
msgid "[_C_] Relax.... it's not costing you anything.... I brought it from home."
