# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18895 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_aunt_clean_kitchen_42032081:
msgid "[_R_] Cuz if you don't.... the first bill I'll stop paying is your cycling class."
