# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:18929 #-#-# translate crowdin gal_aunt_clean_kitchen_541867c0:
msgid "[_R_] It's not like I'm attracted to you because you're my aunt, it's more that I've identified a great opportunity to see some real boobs."
