# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:23154 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_73717b7f:
msgid "[_GP_] You should be able to pull anything you need out of your pocket.... you know, like money.... all you need to do is think really hard about it."
