# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:23804 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_91e035b2:
msgid "[_R_] Yeah, I don't think so! Here's the $500, and why don't you take your broom and fly away."
msgstr "[_R_] Sì, non credo proprio! Ecco i 500 dollari, e perché non prendi la tua scopa e voli via."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:23807 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_24e0e0c3:
msgid "[_AD_] Fine!.... But make sure you're home next week! If I have to track you down again, I'm going to be taking both forms of payment."
