# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:23808 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_60388158:
msgid "[_GCP_] Good job! Now let's go give the girls their gift cards, and we'll call today a success!"
