# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25195 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_442a6fa7:
msgid "[_R_] So I've been trying to record all of the notable events for this year. You know.... kind of a journal, so we can look back and remember the good times."
