# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25202 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_8b640395:
msgid "[_S_] I already know it was stupid of me to accept the work that Joey was offering."
msgstr "[_S_] So già che è stato stupido da parte mia accettare il lavoro che Joey stava offrendo."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25203 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_d3f0ac06:
msgid "[_S_] I know it was stupid of me to let him buy me nice things."
msgstr "[_S_] So che è stato stupido da parte mia lasciare che mi comprasse cose carine."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25204 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_8eaa0f5b:
msgid "[_S_] I know it was stupid of me to think he would ever leave his wife for me."
msgstr "[_S_] So che è stato stupido da parte mia pensare che avrebbe mai lasciato sua moglie per me."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25205 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_cf8896cb:
msgid "[_S_] I don't know how, or why, I let him manipulate me to become his tool to blackmail powerful men."
msgstr "[_S_] Non so come, o perché, ho lasciato che mi manipolasse per diventare il suo strumento per ricattare uomini potenti."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25206 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_5b92748b:
msgid "[_S_] I'd sleep with them, and Joey would record it all, to use the pictures later for blackmail."
msgstr "[_S_] Andavo a letto con loro e Joey registrava tutto, per usare le foto in seguito per i ricatti."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25209 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_54bc397b:
msgid "[_S_] And now I've slept with most of the powerful men in the state, and I don't know if my baby's father is Senetor McFeely, Archbishop SaintFister, Governor LeGroper,"
