# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25247 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_b29e8e88:
msgid "[_S_] And yes, we all think you're amazing, and yes we're super grateful for all of the shit you've done for us."
