# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:25250 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_Xmas_event_0572e331:
msgid "[_S_] Because what you did to get us out from under the thumb of those Mafia goons!.... Well, it was so heroic."
